&gt;POSITIVE&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=9.5;fontColor=#64748B;fontStyle=1" vertex="1" parent="c265"><mxGeometry x="557" y="45.26" width="50.08" height="11.9" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c320" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:14.5px&quot;&gt;the same building’s&lt;br&gt;footprint image&lt;br&gt;and floor area&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#1E293B" vertex="1" parent="c265"><mxGeometry x="557" y="60.27" width="123.99" height="43.5" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c321" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:16.5px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:bold&quot;&gt;Trains&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;margin-left:3.3px&quot;&gt;V only (ResNet-18 + projections), lr 1e-3; T is frozen. Quiz: 64 buildings, distinct tags. 1,250 steps.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:bold&quot;&gt;Learns&lt;/span&gt;: a building’s V becomes most similar to the T of its own type.&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1E293B" vertex="1" parent="c265"><mxGeometry x="16" y="121.09" width="705.54" height="33" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c322" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:15px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:bold&quot;&gt;Leeds&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;margin-left:3.3px&quot;&gt;v5: a building’s class (of 18) can be read from its footprint 57% of the time (floor area alone 19%);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;matching fo